==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|loch}}, from {{inh|de|goh|louh}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*laukaz}}. Compare {{cog|nds|Look}}, {{m|nds|look}}, {{cog|nl|look}}, {{cog|en|leek}}, {{cog|da|løg}}, {{cog|sv|lök}}.

